{"seq":2,"slug":"steering-stability","title":"转向与稳定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/vehicle-physics/dynamics/steering-stability","wordCount":1204,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"转向与稳定性\">转向与稳定性</h1><p>方向盘转 30 度，前轮该转多少？两个前轮转的角度该一样吗？车头会乖乖跟着指向，还是冲出弯外、或者尾巴先甩出去？这些问题的答案藏在转向几何与前后轴抓地的微妙平衡里。<a href=\"../wheels-tires/traction-slip\">牵引与打滑</a>从单个轮胎的滑移角讲了推头与甩尾的微观成因，本篇把镜头拉到整车：转向输入如何变成四个轮子的转角，前后轴谁先到达抓地极限如何决定车辆的&quot;性格&quot;，以及游戏如何用稳定性辅助避免新手原地打转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>转向把玩家输入变成前轮转角，前轮的横向力产生绕质心的偏航力矩让车头转向。前后轴横向力的平衡决定车辆中性、欠转还是过转。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    INPUT[转向输入] --&gt; ACK[Ackermann 几何&lt;br/&gt;内外轮异角]&#10;    ACK --&gt; FANGLE[前轮转角 δ]&#10;    FANGLE --&gt; FSLIP[前轮滑移角]&#10;    FSLIP --&gt; FY_F[前轴横向力]&#10;    YAW[车辆偏航/惯性] --&gt; RSLIP[后轮滑移角]&#10;    RSLIP --&gt; FY_R[后轴横向力]&#10;    FY_F --&gt; BALANCE{前后轴&lt;br/&gt;谁先到极限}&#10;    FY_R --&gt; BALANCE&#10;    BALANCE --&gt;|前轴先滑| UNDER[欠转&lt;br/&gt;推头冲出弯]&#10;    BALANCE --&gt;|后轴先滑| OVER[过转&lt;br/&gt;甩尾打转]&#10;    BALANCE --&gt;|平衡| NEUTRAL[中性转向]&#10;    UNDER --&gt; ESC[稳定辅助介入]&#10;    OVER --&gt; ESC\">flowchart TD\n    INPUT[转向输入] --&gt; ACK[Ackermann 几何&lt;br/&gt;内外轮异角]\n    ACK --&gt; FANGLE[前轮转角 δ]\n    FANGLE --&gt; FSLIP[前轮滑移角]\n    FSLIP --&gt; FY_F[前轴横向力]\n    YAW[车辆偏航/惯性] --&gt; RSLIP[后轮滑移角]\n    RSLIP --&gt; FY_R[后轴横向力]\n    FY_F --&gt; BALANCE{前后轴&lt;br/&gt;谁先到极限}\n    FY_R --&gt; BALANCE\n    BALANCE --&gt;|前轴先滑| UNDER[欠转&lt;br/&gt;推头冲出弯]\n    BALANCE --&gt;|后轴先滑| OVER[过转&lt;br/&gt;甩尾打转]\n    BALANCE --&gt;|平衡| NEUTRAL[中性转向]\n    UNDER --&gt; ESC[稳定辅助介入]\n    OVER --&gt; ESC</pre><p>下表对照三种转向特性，它们由前后轴抓地分配决定，是车辆操控性格的核心。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>物理成因</th>\n<th>驾驶感受</th>\n<th>调校手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>欠转（推头）</td>\n<td>前轴先达抓地极限</td>\n<td>车头冲出弯外</td>\n<td>增前抓地/减前重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过转（甩尾）</td>\n<td>后轴先达抓地极限</td>\n<td>车尾滑出、易打转</td>\n<td>增后抓地/减后重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中性</td>\n<td>前后轴同时到极限</td>\n<td>跟手、可控</td>\n<td>配重 50:50 调校</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ackermann-转向几何\">Ackermann 转向几何</h2><p>最朴素的转向是&quot;两个前轮转同样角度&quot;，但这在低速急弯会出错：过弯时内外前轮各自描的圆弧半径不同，内轮的弧更小、本该转更大的角。若两轮同角，必有一个轮在&quot;拖着走&quot;、产生不必要的滑移与磨损。Ackermann 几何修正了这点——让内侧前轮比外侧转得更多，使两轮的转向轴线交于后轴延长线上的同一圆心：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cot</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>cot</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>W</mi><mi>L</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cot\\delta_{outer} - \\cot\\delta_{inner} = \\frac{W}{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cot</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cot</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">inn</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是轮距、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是轴距。游戏里是否实现完整 Ackermann 取决于拟真度：高速赛车其实常用接近平行甚至反 Ackermann 的几何（高速时载荷外移，外轮才是主力），而低速越野、停车场景实现 Ackermann 收益明显。多数街机游戏直接两前轮同角，肉眼几乎看不出差别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"欠转与过转-车辆的性格\">欠转与过转：车辆的性格</h2><p>一辆车过弯时是&quot;推头&quot;还是&quot;甩尾&quot;，取决于前轴和后轴哪一根先把横向力用到极限（横向滑移角越过摩擦曲线峰值）。前轴先到极限，前轮先失去抓地，车头不再跟手、直挺挺冲出弯外，这是<strong>欠转</strong>（understeer），安全但慢；后轴先到极限，车尾先滑出、车头猛然转向甚至打转，这是<strong>过转</strong>（oversteer），刺激但难控。</p>\n<p>哪根轴先到极限，由一连串因素决定：配重（前重易欠转）、驱动布局（前驱偏欠转、后驱偏过转，见<a href=\"engine-drivetrain\">引擎与传动</a>）、悬挂软硬（见<a href=\"../wheels-tires/wheel-raycast-suspension\">轮胎射线与悬挂</a>）、以及前后轮胎抓地系数。绕偏航轴的转动惯性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{zz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（见<a href=\"../foundations/rigid-body-chassis\">刚体底盘</a>）则决定车头摆动的快慢。把这套平衡调到&quot;略微欠转保底、出弯可控过转&quot;，是赛车手感的圣杯，详见<a href=\"../practice/vehicle-feel-tuning\">手感调校</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"稳定性辅助与防侧翻\">稳定性辅助与防侧翻</h2><p>完全交给物理，新手会不停打转、翻车，毫无乐趣。于是游戏普遍叠加稳定性辅助，本质是给底盘刚体施加修正力矩或夹紧滑移：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>电子稳定（ESC 类）</strong>：检测车辆实际偏航率与&quot;玩家意图偏航率&quot;的偏差，对个别车轮施加虚拟制动或限扭，把车拉回意图方向，抑制过度甩尾。</li>\n<li><strong>转向辅助 / 反打修正</strong>：甩尾时自动给一点反方向转角，模拟老手的&quot;打方向救车&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>防侧翻约束</strong>：高重心车过弯侧倾力矩过大时，对侧倾施加额外阻尼或直接夹紧侧倾角，避免动不动翻车（也可在<a href=\"../foundations/rigid-body-chassis\">刚体底盘</a>里靠压低质心从源头缓解）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些辅助的强度是一个连续旋钮：街机游戏开到很强让车&quot;贴轨道&quot;，拟真游戏可全关让玩家自负盈亏。开多强属于<a href=\"../practice/arcade-vs-sim\">街机与拟真取舍</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>转向把输入变前轮转角，前轮横向力产生偏航力矩让车头转向；Ackermann 几何让内外轮异角避免低速拖滑。</li>\n<li>欠转/过转由前后轴谁先达抓地极限决定，受配重、驱动布局、悬挂、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{zz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 共同影响。</li>\n<li>调校目标常是&quot;略欠转保底、可控过转出弯&quot;，是手感核心。</li>\n<li>稳定辅助（ESC/反打/防侧翻）给底盘施修正力矩，强度是街机↔拟真的连续旋钮。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>微观成因：<a href=\"../wheels-tires/traction-slip\">牵引与打滑</a>；偏航惯性：<a href=\"../foundations/rigid-body-chassis\">刚体底盘</a></li>\n<li>驱动布局影响：<a href=\"engine-drivetrain\">引擎与传动</a></li>\n<li>跨库（约束求解，稳定辅助本质）：<a href=\"../game-physics/collision-response/constraint-solver\">游戏物理 / 约束求解</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"转向与稳定性","id":"转向与稳定性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Ackermann 转向几何","id":"ackermann-转向几何"},{"level":2,"text":"欠转与过转：车辆的性格","id":"欠转与过转-车辆的性格"},{"level":2,"text":"稳定性辅助与防侧翻","id":"稳定性辅助与防侧翻"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"引擎与传动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/vehicle-physics/dynamics/engine-drivetrain"},"next":{"title":"空气动力与下压力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/vehicle-physics/dynamics/aerodynamics-downforce"}}